      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You don't mention it, but if you're on a hand-tracking capable device then it feels *bad* not being able to.  I have to point and pinch and hope I don't move my hand too much, when I could just PUSH THE BUTTON.\n\nWith hand tracking, those aren't just my avatar's fingers. They are, essentially MY fingers. And it's natural to touch stuff and push buttons.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
